'''Monk [[Ascalon armor]]''' is an art type introduced in the Prophecies campaign as starter armor (named Roughspun) and is also available in the Factions campaign.

'''Note''': Monk Ascalon armor does not have headgear, but the [[Monk Dragon armor|Dragon Scalp Design]] is available from the same armorer in Factions. Pictures and crafting details are available on that page.

There is no [[prestige armor|prestige]] version of this armor.

